images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scl20n.jpg"}], "slug": "flutter-away", "storyline": "Set up camp, walk the nearby tracks and enjoy the beauty of the rainforest at whatever pace is most comfortable. Search for mushrooms, frogs, flowers and other rainforest life as a skilled butterfly researcher. Photograph discoveries to reveal more in a detailed nature journal. Encounter all kinds of creatures and plant life. Build a friendship with a shy Capybara and discover her secret!\n\nExperience the relaxing feeling of spending time alone in nature. Enjoy the soothing ambiance of the cascading waterfall, capture the magnificent hues of the sunset through your lens, and marvel at the twinkling stars that light up the night sky.", "summary": "Enjoy the serenity of the Amazon rainforest in this cozy short nature exploration game. As a butterfly researcher on a five-day campaign trip, explore nearby tracks, take photos, meet animal friends, and journal the discoveries found along the way!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/flutter-away", "videos": [{"id": 87226, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "M9u_9V0RpHY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M9u_9V0RpHY", "title": "Flutter Away Announcement Trailer - Runaway Play", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M9u_9V0RpHY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 91521, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "mHrK5cAw5rM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mHrK5cAw5rM", "title": "Flutter Away | Wholesome Direct 2023 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mHrK5cAw5rM/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 12451, "name": "Flutter"}]}